# Harness residue, never repo content. A plugin host that fails to expand
# CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA creates a directory named after the literal variable
# in whatever cwd it started in -- including a worktree. It reached main
# once through `git add -A`.
${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA}/

